# "OthelloLab/README.md"
# OthelloLab

OthelloLab is a compact research and production codebase for Othello/Reversi. It provides a validated board implementation, deterministic game engine, classical AI agents, self-play dataset generation, evaluation tools, a command line interface, JSON persistence, and an optional FastAPI service.

## Install

```bash
python -m pip install -e .[dev]
```

## Play from the terminal

```bash
othello play --black human --white minimax --depth 4
```

## Run evaluations

```bash
othello evaluate --black mcts --white minimax --games 20 --mcts-rollouts 200 --depth 3
```

## Generate self-play records

```bash
othello self-play --agent mcts --games 10 --output data/selfplay.jsonl
```

## Serve an API

```bash
othello-serve --host 127.0.0.1 --port 8000
```

The service exposes endpoints for legal moves, applying a move, and asking an agent for a move.

